    <briefdescription>
<para>Factory for a <computeroutput>RpcPhase2Fn</computeroutput> that sends Phase-2 COMMIT/ROLLBACK over gRPC, with exponential-backoff retry (3 attempts: 100 ms / 200 ms / 400 ms). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#ifdef<sp/>THEMIS_HAS_CORE_GRPC</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_distributed_transaction_manager_1a41bbdde61b6b2747ffedf7f58eb675b6" kindref="member">DistributedTransactionManager::setRpcPhase2Fn</ref>(</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1transaction_1_1_grpc_rpc_phase2_adapter_1a48bf7a579a356c72fb55b64c191fc9b2" kindref="member">GrpcRpcPhase2Adapter::make</ref>(node_addresses,<sp/>2000<ref refid="test__wave4c__t1t4__hardening_8cpp_1ac3a080cca78ca980a69d1cb9b76615eb" kindref="member">ms</ref>));</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="preprocessor">#endif</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>The callable throws <computeroutput>std::runtime_error</computeroutput> after all retries are exhausted so the coordinator&apos;s <computeroutput>runPhase2Unlocked()</computeroutput> can surface the partial-failure to its WAL and caller. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
